caption: Chem Capacity and Overdose
technology-rule: chem-capacity-and-overdose

Chems are Temporary Physical buffs.

A character’s Chem Capacity is equal to their Temporary Physical buff limit:

Chem Capacity = max(1, floor(HT / 5) + Highest Relevant Physical Talent)

Each uncleared integrated chem occupies one point of Chem Capacity.

Separate chems each occupy one point, even if physically mixed.

Repeated doses of the same chem each occupy another point until they clear.
